      <abstract>
        <p>学术文档结构识别是文献数字化中的关键任务。本文提出了一种融合LayoutLM与图神经网络的混合架构，用于自动识别学术论文中的章节标题、段落、公式、图表和参考文献等结构元素。在构建的中文学术论文数据集上，该方法在标题层级识别任务中达到96.3%的F1分数，在公式定位任务中达到94.7%的准确率。实验结果表明，图神经网络能有效捕捉文档元素间的空间关系，显著提升了版面分析的鲁棒性。</p>
      </abstract>
      <abstract xml:lang="en">
        <p>Document structure recognition is a key task in literature digitization. This paper proposes a hybrid architecture combining LayoutLM and Graph Neural Networks (GNN) to automatically recognize structural elements in academic papers, including section titles, paragraphs, formulas, figures, tables, and references. On a constructed Chinese academic paper dataset, the method achieves an F1 score of 96.3% on heading hierarchy recognition and 94.7% accuracy on formula localization. Experimental results show that GNN can effectively capture spatial relationships among document elements, significantly improving the robustness of layout analysis.</p>
      </abstract>
